    "content": "<p>Maintaining health naturally is about alignment with your body’s biological needs. 1. <b>Natural Sunlight:</b> 15 minutes of morning sun helps regulate your circadian rhythm. 2. <b>Whole Foods:</b> Prioritize foods that don’t have a labels. 3. <b>Movement:</b> Think of movement as \"nutrition\" for your joints.</p><p>By focusing on these pillars, you reduce the toxic load on your liver and allow your immune system to spend its energy on protection rather than constant inflammation management.</p>",
